<p>also: If telling off the guys in charge of the budget, by saying how crazy the shit you see is, is all that is necessary to get funding from them&#8230; why hasn't it already happened? This can't have been the first guy to try it. Why wouldn't the board member have a response ready?</p>
<p>This is as unbelievable as those Chick tracts where as soon as people mention Jesus, people turn their backs on science and community and say &quot;Wow, really? You say he died&#8230; for *my* sins?&quot; If you love seeing heathens get converted, you think those scenes are very viscerally satisfying. If you think about it for a quarter of a second, you realize this is a person being swayed by things they must have heard hundreds and hundreds of times already.</p>

